\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Our diagnostic VLM. The anchor is \emph  {never} fed to the decoder (which always reads LLaMA embeddings); only the connector is pulled toward it. The AR path trains the captioner; the geometry path shapes the connector-output gap.}}{1}{figure.1}\protected@file@percent }
